    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dear Valued Customer,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thank you for calling the Dreamline Service Center.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We are committed to providing every wanderer user with the highest quality dream services. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>How may I help you today?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039020/extras/e2f838100db8f6f5f43dd55142716e98.avif?t=1746451761\" data-has-big width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>                                                    </u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Dreamline 404&quot; is a short-form experimental game centered around phone calls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the night, you're woken up by a text message from the &quot;Dreamline Service Center.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Congratulations, you're a winner!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably just a scam, you think. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the message's glitchy text and overall strangeness spark your curiosity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your phone, a mysterious message, and a weird number you can't resist calling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dial into the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039020/extras/30f320ef215ad33108c5d1c1a091e581.avif?t=1746451761\" data-has-big width=800 height=204 /></span><u>                                                    </u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a diverse collection of dreams from Wanderer users. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let our original soundtrack wash over you as you find your inner peace within vibrant dreamscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039020/extras/426363a5a4e7308d4d3f590a67fab065.avif?t=1746451761\" data-has-big width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please remember that Dreamline Corporation is your one and only trusted friend on this dream journey. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Dreamline, we're all about following your dreams. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So let's make your life one where... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...Where all your dreams are not just your dreams. :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039020/extras/3bc63c9fc3c9ec62799d82dd3004d8ff.avif?t=1746451761\" data-has-big width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039020/extras/606d685ef6fb24478903e989ea66f184.avif?t=1746451761\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contact us</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Game Design / Art / Narrative By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@Blu\u00a0 <a href=\"mailto:Daydreaminblu_studio@outlook.com\">Daydreaminblu_studio@outlook.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Programming By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@VoidCatt\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:voidcattdev@gmail.com\">voidcattdev@gmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Music By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > @Yellow\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:yunhaohwang@gmail.com\">yunhaohwang@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Localization by <strong>Max Ponoroff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
