/strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Game Design / Art / Narrative By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@Blu\u00a0 <a href=\"mailto:Daydreaminblu_studio@outlook.com\">Daydreaminblu_studio@outlook.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Programming By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@VoidCatt\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:voidcattdev@gmail.com\">voidcattdev@gmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Music By</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > @Yellow\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:yunhaohwang@gmail.com\">yunhaohwang@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Localization by <strong>Max Ponoroff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
